## ✨ About Rahaei

**Rahaei** (meaning "Liberation" in Persian) is an advanced, modular, and intelligent Telegram Self-Bot built with Python and Pyrogram. It gives you **complete control** over your Telegram account with AI-powered features, security tools, and entertainment modules.

> **"Rahaei - Where Freedom Meets Intelligence"**

---

## 🌟 Key Features

| Category | Features |
|----------|----------|
| 🤖 **AI & NLP** | GPT-4, Gemini AI, Smart Replies, Translation, Text Summarization |
| 🔐 **Security** | Flood Protection, Spam Detection, Anti-Ban System, Permission Levels |
| 🎮 **Entertainment** | Interactive Games, Tournaments, Leaderboards, Daily Challenges |
| 🛠 **Tools** | Download Manager, Format Converter, OCR, QR Code Generator |
| 🌐 **Web Panel** | Full Dashboard, Live Stats, Remote Control, Reports |
| 🔄 **Self-Healing** | Auto-Restart, Error Recovery, FloodWait Management |
| 📊 **Analytics** | User Activity, Group Stats, Weekly Reports, Behavior Analysis |

---

## 📋 Basic Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `.help` | Show help menu |
| `.panel` | Open control panel |
| `.ai <text>` | Chat with AI |
| `.ping` | Check bot speed |
| `.stats` | View statistics |
| `.backup` | Create backup |
| `.update` | Update the bot |

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```

rahaee/
├── src/                 # Core source code
│   ├── core/           # Main engine
│   ├── modules/        # Feature modules
│   └── web/            # Web dashboard
├── data/               # Database files
├── logs/               # System logs
├── docs/               # Documentation
└── scripts/            # Utility scripts

```

---

## 🚀 Quick Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/mo3ymegatron/Rahaee-self-bot.git
cd Rahaee-self-bot

# Run automatic setup
bash scripts/setup.sh

# Configure environment
nano .env

# Start the bot
python main.py
```

